# Tests/Sema/Incremental/replay_aside.k, over Inputs/aside in s/: texts that
# are tried and thrown away (`aside`, LiveCheck::aside), between edits that
# are kept. Each aside starts from the kept text, as each keystroke of a
# line being typed starts from the last text that parsed.
# A semantic error in a function that stays healthy: every aside of lib.k
# below has to report it, beside its own syntax errors.
step semantic_error_in_a_healthy_function
replace s/lib.k:::return p.x + p.y:::return p.x + p.nope
# Errors in the middle of one body, a complete statement after them.
step break_inside_a_body
aside replace s/lib.k:::var a = p.x * k:::var a = = 1
aside replace s/lib.k:::var a = p.x * k:::var a = p.
aside replace s/lib.k:::var a = p.x * k:::var a = p.x * (k +
step fixed_by_a_kept_edit
replace s/lib.k:::var a = p.x * k:::var a = k * p.x
step semantic_error_fixed
replace s/lib.k:::p.nope:::p.y
# Outside every body: the file is left unchecked, its syntax errors alone.
step break_outside_a_body
aside replace s/lib.k:::// SLOT:::pub fn (
step kept_edit_after_it
append s/lib.k:::\n// t\n
# other.k is broken while the importers of lib.k are still queued.
step break_while_importers_are_queued
replace s/lib.k:::var a = k * p.x:::var a = p.x * k
aside replace s/other.k:::var y = x:::var y = = x
drain 1
aside replace s/other.k:::var y = x:::var y = = x
# lib.k broken, another file edited and kept, lib.k still broken, then fixed.
step break_then_edit_another_file
aside replace s/lib.k:::var b = p.y * k:::var b = = 2
replace s/other.k:::return y + 1:::return 1 + y
aside replace s/lib.k:::var b = p.y * k:::var b = = 2
step fixed
replace s/lib.k:::var b = p.y * k:::var b = k * p.y
# The entry: nothing imports it, so its first tier leaves no queue. A text
# with a name nothing declares (what a completion request plants), and one
# with an error in the middle of its body.
step try_the_entry
aside replace s/main.k:::    return mid() + use_other():::    kalsCompletionMarker\n    return mid() + use_other()
aside replace s/main.k:::    return mid() + use_other():::    var m = = 1\n    return mid() + use_other()
step entry_kept_edit
replace s/main.k:::return mid() + use_other():::return use_other() + mid()
